{
  "declaredLength": 1384,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "嘿！歡迎歡迎！！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563FFF016B618FCE6B618FCEFF01FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "左轉轉，右轉轉，\n每個食材都在轉轉轉。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE68F498F49FF0C53F38F498F49FF0C000A6BCF500B98DF675090FD57288F498F498F4930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "確實有些食材\n很快就會壞掉了呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78BA5BE667094E9B98DF6750000A5F885FEB5C31670358DE63894E86546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃得太急\n結果噎到了……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54035F97592A6025000A7D50679C564E52304E8620262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說這家店用的食材都是\n從很遠的地區捕來的喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA90195BB65E977528768498DF675090FD662F000A5F9E5F88906076845730534063554F867684559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好厲害！你真是博學多聞！！\n（雖然是從蔚藍灣捕來的食材就是了。）",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D53B25BB3FF014F60771F662F535A5B78591A805EFF01FF01000AFF0896D67136662F5F9E851A85CD706363554F86768498DF67505C31662F4E863002FF090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在回轉夢想家，寶可夢對戰\n也是讓人鬥志滿滿。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572856DE8F49592260F35BB6FF0C5BF653EF59225C0D6230000A4E5F662F8B934EBA9B255FD76EFF6EFF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我不是很懂，\n但這就是所謂的別緻風情嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662114E0D662F5F8861C2FF0C000A4F4690195C31662F62408B02768452257DFB98A860C555CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果要用手吃的話，\n也模仿一下師傅的手法吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C89817528624B540376848A71FF0C000A4E5F6A214EFF4E004E0B5E2B50857684624B6CD5542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以輕鬆享用的\n壽司最棒了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE58F159B064EAB75287684000A58FD53F8670068D24E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到底是發生了什麼事\n才會用這種吃法啊？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52305E95662F767C751F4E864EC09EBC4E8B000A624D6703752890197A2E54036CD5554AFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和阿羅拉地區的店舖相比，\n味道有細微的不同……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C963F7F8562C95730534076845E97821676F86BD4FF0C000A5473905367097D305FAE76844E0D540C202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這孩子會超越老頭兒我……\n該從現在就開始鍛鍊舌頭。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195B695B5067038D858D8A8001982D5152621120262026000A8A725F9E73FE57285C31958B59CB935B934A820C982D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當個會捏壽司的訓練家\n好像也不錯耶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7576500B6703634F58FD53F876848A137DF45BB6000A597D50CF4E5F4E0D932F803630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "敬請細細品味。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "656C8ACB7D307D3054C1547330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回轉夢想家的味道和價格\n真的匹配嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE8F49592260F35BB6768454739053548C50F9683C000A771F76845339914D55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "壽司捲……\n誘惑人心的絕妙搭配……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "58FD53F8637220262026000A8A9860D14EBA5FC376847D555999642D914D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能享受未知食材的從容\n不正是對戰時也需要的態度嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD4EAB53D7672A77E598DF675076845F9E5BB9000A4E0D6B63662F5C0D623066424E5F970089817684614B5EA655CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊，不管出現什麼樣的對手都不吃驚，\n純粹地享受對戰就對了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554AFF0C4E0D7BA151FA73FE4EC09EBC6A2376845C0D624B90FD4E0D54039A5AFF0C000A7D147CB957304EAB53D75C0D62305C315C0D4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "決定好要點什麼了嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C7A5B9A597D89819EDE4EC09EBC4E8655CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "壽司它……壽司它……\n會自己跑到我嘴巴裡面啦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "58FD53F85B832026202658FD53F85B8320262026000A670381EA5DF18DD15230621156345DF488E19762556630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "壽司會不小心\n越吃越多呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "58FD53F867034E0D5C0F5FC3000A8D8A54038D8A591A546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃太多可是會想睡覺的喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403592A591A53EF662F670360F3776189BA7684559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鼻子突然嗆了一下！？\n怎麼會這麼刺激！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9F3B5B507A81713655C64E864E004E0BFF01FF1F000A600E9EBC670390199EBC523A6FC0FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是芥末啦，聽說在帕底亞\n會拿來當作醬汁。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F82A5672B5566FF0C807D8AAA57285E155E954E9E000A670362FF4F8675764F5C91AC6C4130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "街上的寶可夢變多了\n就意味著商機！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88574E0A76845BF653EF59228B8A591A4E86000A5C31610F5473845755466A5FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們是為了慶祝成功簽約\n而來這裡用餐的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115011662F70BA4E866176795D6210529F7C3D7D04000A800C4F86901988E175289910768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回轉夢想家設有海外分店。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE8F49592260F35BB68A2D67096D77591652065E9730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    }
  ],
